      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1 如果两个点不同，那么从一个点到另一个点的距离大",
        "于零；如果两个点重合，距离等于零；如果$A\\ne B$，那",
        "么$|AB|>0$；如果$A=B$，那么$|AB|=0$．**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从$A$点到$B$点的距离等于",
        "$3\\mathrm{cm}$（图7）．从$B$点到$A$点的",
        "距离是多大？当然也是$3\\mathrm{cm}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 7",
      "box": [
        843,
        406,
        333,
        130
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-07"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 7",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**2 对于任意两点$A$和$B$来",
        "说，从$A$到$B$的距离等于",
        "从$B$到$A$的距离：",
        "$|AB|=|BA|$．**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "你自己作出三点$A$、$B$、$C$．",
        "量出距离$|AB|$、$|AC|$、$|BC|$，并",
        "比较$|AB|+|BC|$与距离$|AC|$的",
        "大小．不论你怎样选取点$A$、$B$、",
        "$C$，都会得出距离$|AC|$小于或等",
        "于$|AB|+|BC|$（图8）．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 8",
      "box": [
        861,
        676,
        374,
        495
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-08"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 8",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**3 对于任意三点$A$、$B$、$C$来说，距离$|AC|$小于或者等于",
        "距离$|AB|$与$|BC|$的和：",
        "$|AC|\\leqslant|AB|+|BC|$．**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通常把性质1、2和3叫做距离的基本性质．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 距离的基本性质，实际上只能近似地、通过个别的例",
        "子加以验证．在几何中把这些基本性质看作是完全正确的．",
        "在我们的几何课程中，这些性质是不加证明就予以承认的．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用距离的基本性质，可以证明其他的命题．例如，下面",
        "我们来证明："
      ]
    },
